  "term": "same-sex marriage",
  "definition": "Same-sex marriage is the legal right for a person to marry a partner of the same sex. In the literature provided, it is discussed as an equal marriage right linked to psychosocial effects such as greater social acceptance and less stigma for sexual minority people, even though stigma can still continue.",
